        },
        "controls": [
          "byte-identical prior RESIDE qualification record",
          "exact reproduction of the archived strict Haze4K mapping and OTS exclusion digests",
          "100 percent top-64 recall and top-one recovery on all 458 known strict OTS mappings",
          "exact reproduction of all 492 SOTS-outdoor OTS exclusions",
          "one-to-one and bidirectional nearest-neighbour checks for the 42 unresolved groups",
